xt": "ὁ νῦν π. λόγος Pl. R. 545b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". = προτίθημι "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.3", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", offer, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἆθλα X. Cyr. 2.1.23", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". show beforehand, foreshow, esp. of oracles and divine revelations, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 7.37", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Tr. 849", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 4.5.15", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; π. πολὺν καρπόν have a great promise of fruit, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Thphr. HP 4.14.9", "author_abbreviation": "Thphr.", "tlg_author": "0093", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": folld. by a relat. clause, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ δαίμων π. ὡς αὐτὸς μὲν τελευτήσειν . . μέλλοι Hdt. 1.210", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὅκως στρατιὴν πέμψεις . . , οὐ προφαίνεις holdest out no hope that . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 7.161", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": c. inf., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τόν μοι ὁ δαίμων π. ἐν τῇ ὄψει ἐπαναστήσεσθαι Id. 3.65", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". seemingly intr. (the cogn. acc